docs/artifacts/claude-code-kickoff.md:20:8. Scheduled runtime (§5.5a): Solid Queue jobs calling the Anthropic Messages API with read-only tool definitions, hard tool-turn cap, email output. Implement the 07:00 brief and 16:30 EOD; Sunday review can be a stub that emails the re-auth link and token age.
docs/artifacts/claude-code-kickoff.md:28:- **No live Schwab calls in tests.** VCR/WebMock cassettes only, scrubbed of tokens and encrypted account values. A `FakeSchwab` adapter backs Playwright and dev seeds.
docs/artifacts/claude-code-kickoff.md:39:- Playwright for the clickable UI: dashboard in all four banner states against seeded data, MCP auth failure page, re-auth success/failure.
docs/artifacts/claude-code-kickoff.md:40:- `bin/ci` runs in order: rubocop, rspec, brakeman, `bin/importmap audit`, `bundle exec bundle-audit check --update`, Playwright. Fail fast.
docs/artifacts/claude-code-kickoff.md:41:- Idiomatic Rails per the DHH skill: thin controllers, models that do the work, no service-object ceremony unless there is a real reason. Run the DHH skill as a review pass at the end of the phase.
