hook: PostToolUse
hook: PostToolUse Completed
codex
The controller is minimal and relies on the normal Rails request stack, but the more interesting risk is that `:delisted` only changes the instrument while `Position#protection` memoizes by stop id. I’m checking whether callers use freshly loaded positions or can reuse a stale protection value after the flag changes.
