     1	# Links one account's activities into trades, one activity per transaction: find or insert the leg, recompute
     2	# the trade from its legs, then stamp journaled_at last. A rerun finds the leg and recomputes. One failing
     3	# activity flags its trade and is skipped, so the rest of the account keeps journaling.
